      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 磅"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已选择 %lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld sessions selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已选择 %lld 个会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld sessions with open terminals will be skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将跳过 %lld 个终端已打开的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld subagent sessions stay on disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个子代理会话将保留在磁盘上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld tool calls": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 次工具调用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Open tabs** lists every tab with what its CLI is doing. ⌘1 to ⌘8 go to a tab by its position, and ⌘9 to the last.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**已打开** 列出每个标签页及其 CLI 正在做什么。⌘1 到 ⌘8 按位置切换标签页，⌘9 切换到最后一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Resume** continues this conversation in its CLI, in its original folder. Double-clicking the session in the sidebar does the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**继续** 会在原来的文件夹中用它的 CLI 接着这段对话。在侧栏双击这个会话也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Resume**, or a double-click, continues the conversation in its CLI and original folder. **Branch**, where the CLI supports it, starts a new session from a copy and leaves the original as it was.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**继续**（或双击会话）会在原来的 CLI 和文件夹中接着这段对话。**分支** 会从对话的副本开始一个新会话，原会话保持不变，仅部分 CLI 支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**⌘N** starts a session in any installed CLI, or a plain terminal. Tabs group by project, and **Open tabs** in the sidebar lists them all. Right-click a tab to show two side by side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**⌘N** 可用任一已安装的 CLI 开始会话，或打开普通终端。标签页按项目分组，侧边栏的 **已打开** 会列出全部标签页。右键单击标签页可将两个并排显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 message": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 条消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 session with an open terminal will be skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将跳过 1 个终端已打开的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 subagent session stays on disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 个子代理会话将保留在磁盘上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 tool call": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 次工具调用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A CLI still running in tmux reattaches. Other sessions resume when you select their tab, including after a Mac restart. Plain terminals open a new shell in their folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍在 tmux 中运行的 CLI 会重新连接。其他会话在选中标签时继续，包括 Mac 重启后的会话。普通终端会在原文件夹打开新 shell。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A session whose subagents ran sessions of their own gets a chevron before its icon. Click it to list them under the session and read them. Kiro's aren't listed; on SSH hosts, only Codex's and Antigravity's are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若会话的子代理运行了自己的会话，该会话图标前会出现一个箭头。点击它即可在该会话下列出并阅读这些会话。不列出 Kiro 的子代理会话；SSH 主机上仅列出 Codex 和 Antigravity 的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A subagent ran this session for the session that started it. It can be read here, but not resumed or deleted on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子代理为启动它的会话运行了此会话。可以在这里阅读，但不能单独继续或删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A+": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
