            "value": "标签页和窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs grouped by project": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标签页按项目分组"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the Tour": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the tour": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal appearance preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端外观预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal colors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端配色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Antigravity session database, associated folder, and annotations will move to the macOS Trash. This also removes its entry from Antigravity's local index.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antigravity 会话数据库、关联文件夹和注释将移到 macOS 废纸篓，并从 Antigravity 本地索引中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Claude Code session file and its associated folder will move to the macOS Trash. This also removes its entry from Claude Code's local index.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 会话文件及其关联文件夹将移到 macOS 废纸篓，并从 Claude Code 本地索引中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Pi session file and its associated folder will be permanently deleted on %@. SSH hosts have no Trash, so this cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 上的 Pi 会话文件及其关联文件夹将被永久删除。SSH 主机没有废纸篓，此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Pi session file and its associated folder will move to the macOS Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pi 会话文件及其关联文件夹将移到 macOS 废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder is listed under %@ in the sidebar, ready for new sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件夹会列在侧边栏的 %@ 下，可直接在其中新建会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host needs:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机需要："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project folder is no longer at %@. Move it back there to resume this session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目文件夹已不在 %@。把它移回原处即可继续这个会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project folder no longer exists": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目文件夹已不存在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project will be archived; skipped sessions stay on disk and come back when it is restored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目将被归档；被跳过的会话仍保留在磁盘上，恢复项目后会重新显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project will stay in the sidebar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目仍会保留在侧栏中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The projects will be archived; skipped sessions stay on disk and come back when they are restored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目将被归档；被跳过的会话仍保留在磁盘上，恢复项目后会重新显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shell and anything still running in it will stop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "shell 及其中仍在运行的进程都会停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sidebar lists sessions from %@ by host and project. Search matches project names and paths, session titles and IDs, and message text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "侧边栏按主机和项目列出来自 %@ 的会话。搜索可匹配项目名称和路径、会话标题和 ID，以及消息内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal process will stop. Sessions saved by the CLI will appear in the project list after refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端进程会停止。CLI 已保存的会话将在刷新后出现在项目列表中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tmux sessions the app starts on a host have no prefix key, so every key reaches the CLI. To use your own tmux prefix there, point at the host's heading, click its **⋯**, and choose **Use this host's tmux prefix**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 在主机上启动的 tmux 会话没有前缀键，所以每个按键都会传给 CLI。如果想在那里使用你自己的 tmux 前缀键，请将指针移到该主机的标题上，点按它的 **⋯**，然后选择 **使用此主机的 tmux 前缀键**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tour points at the main controls in the window. Afterwards, tips show again the first time you use each part, such as tabs or split view.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引导会指出窗口中的主要控件。之后，你第一次用到各个部分时（例如标签页或拆分视图），提示会再次出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no folder %@ on %@. Create it to add the project.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "There is no folder %1$@ on %2$@. Create it to add the project."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%2$@ 上没有文件夹 %1$@。创建它即可添加此项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This affects all tools in %@, including sessions hidden by the current filter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作会影响 %@ 中所有工具的会话，包括被当前筛选条件隐藏的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This affects all tools in %lld projects, including sessions hidden by the current filter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作会影响 %lld 个项目中所有工具的会话，包括被当前筛选条件隐藏的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This also deletes %lld subagent sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时会删除 %lld 个子代理会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This also deletes 1 subagent session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时会删除 1 个子代理会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This changes the display name in JustSessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅修改 JustSessions 中的显示名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file isn't an iTerm2 color preset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件不是 iTerm2 配色预设。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session is open in another window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个会话已在另一个窗口中打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session will be permanently deleted on %@. SSH hosts have no Trash, so this cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 上的此会话将被永久删除。SSH 主机没有废纸篓，此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time range": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时间范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
